          "blocks": {
            "row_1": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<h3 style=\"margin:0;font:inherit;\">What's the minimum order for return gifts?</h3>"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Ten pieces is our minimum. Below that, our regular Little and Carry collections work just as well — Return Gifts exists for parties, weddings and corporate orders where everyone receives the same soft, block-printed piece, wrapped and delivered to one address.</p>"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text"]
            },
            "row_2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<h3 style=\"margin:0;font:inherit;\">How long does a bulk order take to arrive?</h3>"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We confirm a firm delivery date the moment we send your quote — usually within 24 hours of your enquiry. Exact production time depends on quantity, product mix and any customisation you ask for, so we'd rather commit to a real date than a generic promise.</p>"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text"]
            },
            "row_3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<h3 style=\"margin:0;font:inherit;\">How is bulk pricing worked out?</h3>"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Pricing scales with quantity, the product mix you choose and any customisation, so we don't publish a flat price list. Share your headcount and budget on the enquiry form and we'll reply with a clear per-piece quote within 24 hours.</p>"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text"]
            },
            "row_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "<h3 style=\"margin:0;font:inherit;\">Can return gifts be personalised with a name or date?</h3>"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Not yet — name or date personalisation like embroidery isn't available today, though it's on our roadmap. Every return gift can still be gift-wrapped with your own note, so the set feels chosen for the occasion rather than off-the-shelf.</p>"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text"]
            }
          },
